.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt OPENSSL-CORE_DISPATCH.H 7ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm openssl/core_dispatch.h
.Nd OpenSSL provider dispatch numbers and function types
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In openssl/core_dispatch.h
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Pa <openssl/core_dispatch.h>
header defines all the operation numbers, dispatch numbers and provider
interface function types currently available.
.Pp
The operation and dispatch numbers are represented with macros, which
are named as follows:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It operation numbers
These macros have the form
.Qo Li OSSL_OP_ Ns Em opname Qc .
.It dipatch numbers
These macros have the form
.Qo Li OSSL_FUNC_ Ns Em opname Ns _ Ns Em funcname Qc ,
where
.Qo Li Em opname Qc
is the same as in the macro for the operation this function belongs to.
.El
.Pp
With every dispatch number, there is an associated function type.
.Pp
For further information, please see the
.Xr provider 7
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr provider 7
.Sh HISTORY
The types and macros described here were added in OpenSSL 3.0.
